{"id":"ed5ba7b91a54af72","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-variable.md","title":"Variable","display":"df-variable — Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-variable","aliases":["56-df-variable"],"display":"df-variable — Variable","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为函数符号集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((x_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为符号序列，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_m=x_n\\iff m=n)\">\\(\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_m=x_n\\iff m=n)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_n\\notin\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_n\\notin\\mathcal F)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为任意符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\{x_n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\{x_n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\iff x\\in\\mathcal V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\iff x\\in\\mathcal V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>变量集可数无限且与函数符号集不交。无参数的 Var 是变量集；Var(t) 在另一原子中表示项 t 中出现的变量集。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1.1–2.1.2，印刷第25–26页，OCR页块46–47。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"(x_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_m=x_n\\iff m=n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x_n\\notin\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\{x_n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Var}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\iff x\\in\\mathcal V.","display":true}],"bytes":983,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-signature]] 的签名，$\\mathcal V$ 为 [[56-df-variable]] 的变量集。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-variable.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}